  "title": "epan: Fix format_text treament of Greek, Arabic, etc.",
  "description": "format_text uses the wrong bitmask when checking for two byte UTF-8\ncharacters, resulting in rejecting half the possible two bytes characters,\nincluding all of Arabic and Greek, and substituting REPLACEMENT CHARACTER\nfor them. Fix #17070, and add some comments about the current behavior\nthat doesn't match existing comments.",
